          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "emit",
          "event": "boots-resolved",
          "data": {
            "method": "tied"
          }
        }
      ],
      "journal": "With his say-so and a length of good rope you tie the captain to his bed, loose enough to breathe and tight enough to argue with. He goes nowhere in the night, and says nothing about it in the morning, which is a kind of thanks."
    },
